=== AC1: Environment-configured links (NOT EXERCISED) ===

Blocker: missing-test-data
Category: Build-time configuration

Reason:
  This AC requires setting REACT_NAV_LINKS environment variable
  before building the application. The QA environment has a
  pre-built app and cannot inject environment variables at runtime.

Manual verification steps documented in qa-plan.md:
  1. Set REACT_NAV_LINKS with custom JSON
  2. Rebuild application (npm run build)
  3. Verify custom links appear in sidebar

Code review evidence:
  - care.config.ts: Parses REACT_NAV_LINKS with validation
  - facility-nav.tsx: Merges envLinks into navigation
  - admin-nav.tsx: Merges envLinks into navigation

Automated coverage:
  - tests/sidebar/navLinks.spec.ts validates baseline structure

